    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dark, humming server room of the abandoned space station 'Aethelgard'. The station's AI has locked down the central systems, including the critical navigation files needed to return to Earth. With oxygen levels slowly depleting and the emergency lights flickering, you must reactivate the station's dormant terminals and bypass a series of intricate security protocols. Your ultimate objective is to decrypt and extract the files from the main core before the life support systems completely fail. Time is running out, and every terminal holds a piece of the puzzle.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
